<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia 2008 T-bond yld averages 8.228 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia 2008 T-bond yld averages 8.228 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of today's A$700 million T-bond tender, announced by Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA):</p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering     Allotted	Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  8.75 Aug 08  AS400 million    A$400 million     8.228     8.21-8.24</p>
<p>(RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 10)  </p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering     Allotted	Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  8.75 Jan 01  AS300 million    A$300.575 million  7.634    7.62-7.64</p>
<p>		   (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 85)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
